WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.400
<i>I'm Koizumi Taiko!</i>

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:34.590
<i>I'm 14 and intent on being the
Great Kanto Desert's #1 skilled beauty!</i>

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:37.900
<i>Oops, wrong one...</i>

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.950
<i>With my pupil Mitsuru,
I beat up bad people of the desert!</i>

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:43.700
<i>Or that was the idea...</i>

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:48.190
<i>Truth is, Mitsuru has Hulkosis
and transforms into a sadistic beast</i>

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:50.250
<i>whenever he's subjected
to an emotional shock.</i>

00:02:52.350 --> 00:02:56.850
<i>Am I gonna be able to fully
utilize Mitsuru down the road?</i>

00:02:57.390 --> 00:03:00.250
<i>After somehow finishing
a job and returning to town,</i>

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:04.470
<i>I found my idol, Natsuko-san,
waiting to give me one heck of a job.</i>

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:05.890
<i>It was to be...</i>

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.970
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:14.280
<i>Security for the Reverse Handyman
Guild's first strategy meeting?!</i>

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:24.620
<i>In the past few months,
villages excavating ruins on their own</i>

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:31.710
<i>and companies like Uzumaki moving away from government control
have come under attack and destruction by the enemy!</i>

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.070
<i>Enemy?</i>

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.290
<i>The government army.</i>

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:39.170
<i>No way! The Oasis government
would kill its own citizens?!</i>

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:41.180
<i>You're so naïve, Haruo.</i>

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:44.800
<i>Have they ever once cared about us?</i>

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:50.770
<i>Besides, you're considered a traitor
if you dig up ruins on your own...</i>

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:56.020
<i>However! If nothing is done,
we will forever be the Oasis' pet dogs!</i>

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.970
<i>Now is the time for we, the RHG,</i>

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.530
<i>to stand up for the happiness
of all desert people!</i>

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:04.610
<i>Happiness, huh...</i>

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:08.160
<i>At any rate, that's what
this conference is for.</i>

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:11.100
<i>But if you're taking on
the government army,</i>

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.750
<i>doesn't that mean you
might run into them again?!</i>

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.950
<i>"Them"?!</i>

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.820
<i>You mean them?!</i>

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:22.590
<i>There's a good possibility.</i>

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:28.890
<i>The compensation will make up for it.
But if you want to decline...</i>

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:33.560
<i>N-no! I'll do it!
They killed my master, after all!</i>

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:38.270
<i>We're in, too! They could
try to kill you, Natsuko!</i>

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:42.490
<i>Yeah! What kind of brothers would
we be if we didn't protect you?!</i>

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:45.280
<i>I-I'll protect you, too, Natsu-ne!</i>

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.470
<i>Thanks, everyone!</i>

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.830
<i>We're counting on you!</i>

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:49.910
<i>Right!</i>

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.600
<i>U-umm, Taiko-san...</i>

00:04:53.470 --> 00:04:54.740
<i>What're you doing?!</i>

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.870
<i>Why aren't you walking the
Kawaharas' Heracles Goldion Beetle?!</i>

00:04:58.420 --> 00:04:59.290
<i>Well...</i>

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:04.090
<i>It kept walking around everywhere,
so when I tugged at it...</i>

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.970
<i>Y-you don't mean!</i>

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:13.530
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm really sorry! I'm really sorry!</i>

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:17.510
<i>Honestly! Just had to do it
when we were broke!</i>

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:17.960
<i>I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</i>

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.440
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.750
<i>Like apologizing will fix anything!</i>

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:23.930
<i>Sorry!</i>

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:28.060
<i>Whatever! Go get us ready for tomorrow!</i>

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:28.760
<i>Right!</i>

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:32.950
<i>Sheesh, can't even
walk a stupid bug right...</i>

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:38.260
<i>Ah well.</i>

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:41.880
<i>H
a
n
d
y
m
a
n
</i>

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:41.880
<i>R
e
v
e
r
s
e
</i>

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.080
<i>Looks like you're ready.</i>

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.460
<i>Yep! All set!</i>

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:50.600
<i>Dark Age monsters or ghosts
or whatever! Bring it on!</i>

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:52.810
<i>Alright! Get on!</i>

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.480
<i>Come on, Mitsuru! Get moving!</i>

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.890
<i>R-right!</i>

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.910
<i>Oh, a job?</i>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:01.150
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:04.820
<i>Looks pretty flashy.
Taking care of bandits?</i>

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.790
<i>Uhh...</i>

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:11.370
<i>Yeah, something like that.
What about you, Matsunami-san?</i>

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:16.860
<i>The misses nags how I should
play with the kids sometimes...</i>

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.420
<i>It must be tough...</i>

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.210
<i>Oh, that reminds me.
I got an interesting job.</i>

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:29.430
<i>It was an order to make a
rocket winch just like ol' Kanta's.</i>

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.480
<i>Daddy!</i>

00:06:33.480 --> 00:06:35.260
<i>Oh, sorry!</i>

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.280
<i>Well, good luck!</i>

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.140
<i>Right!</i>

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:40.170
<i>Oh, Matsunami-san!</i>

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:45.450
<i>If you don't mind,
could I see that winch later?</i>

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:47.080
<i>Sure, no problem.</i>

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.400
<i>We're leavin' now!</i>

00:06:53.590 --> 00:06:55.030
<i>See you later!</i>

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:57.900
<i>- Bye-bye!
- See you later!</i>

00:06:59.320 --> 00:07:00.230
<i>So, you're going...</i>

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.430
<i>...warriors!</i>

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:15.820
<i>"Everyone is calling again today!"</i>

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:20.070
<i>"The denizens
of the desert are crying!"</i>

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.940
<i>"We will crush the evil government!"</i>

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:27.940
<i>"Dreams and justice
and the hopes of the people!"</i>

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.820
<i>"Oh, oh! The West Oasis-"</i>

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:32.320
<i>Reverse!</i>

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:36.480
<i>"-Handyman Guild!"</i>

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.960
<i>So anyways, Taiko-chan.</i>

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.380
<i>How's your pupil comin' along?</i>

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.940
<i>He's pathetic!</i>

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:58.640
<i>He can't use a gun, he's quick to whine,
and he can't even walk a bug!</i>

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:03.440
<i>He'll never be on
the front lines like that!</i>

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.630
<i>What's the matter?</i>

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.320
<i>No, it's nothing...</i>

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.070
<i>We're here.</i>

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.610
<i>Here?</i>

00:08:15.020 --> 00:08:16.530
<i>Smack in the middle of...</i>

00:08:17.550 --> 00:08:19.270
<i>...a skeleton city?</i>

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:23.460
<i>But isn't this...</i>

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.010
<i>Yes. You should recognize it.</i>

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:33.720
<i>It's the place Kaizuka-san found
20 years ago - the 85th skeleton city.</i>

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:37.700
<i>But last time it took a
really long time to get here...</i>

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:42.060
<i>Kaizuka-san is very cautious.
He must've purposely taken a long way.</i>

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:46.570
<i>Then all that suffering was for...</i>

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.400
<i>Now, then.</i>

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:51.400
<i>The security teams are already
in position, but you'll be...</i>

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:54.350
<i>What's that?!</i>

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.030
<i>Taiko-san?!</i>

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:58.870
<i>Idiot! That's "sensei"!
You wait right there!</i>

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.450
<i>You're the one who's waiting!</i>

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.180
<i>But it could be the enemy, you know!</i>

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.900
<i>What the?!</i>

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:13.590
<i>They were beaten to death after
they blasted away like amateurs!</i>

00:09:24.690 --> 00:09:29.150
<i>My, what a crude how-do-you-do...</i>

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.150
<i>Y-you're!</i>

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:32.890
<i>Yo.</i>

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:38.380
<i>I remember you, kiddo.
Name's Kosuna, if I recall.</i>

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:43.450
<i>You used to hang behind
the Sunabouzu like goldfish dung...</i>

00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:44.200
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:09:44.500 --> 00:09:49.210
<i>Anyways, could you lower the gun?
We are both in the RHG...</i>

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.900
<i>L-liar!</i>

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:51.890
<i>It's the truth.</i>

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.240
<i>Natsuko-san?</i>

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:57.000
<i>We hired this man.</i>

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.440
<i>Still, it's odd.</i>

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.840
<i>They were all professional
soldiers with military training.</i>

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:17.530
<i>Yet, they were so easily...</i>

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:18.940
<i>Ooh.</i>

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.930
<i>T-these are...</i>

00:10:22.470 --> 00:10:27.960
<i>Fancy as the equipment may be,
there's no concealing the footprints.</i>

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:31.670
<i>You're alright!</i>

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:33.270
<i>You OK, Natsuko?!</i>

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:34.920
<i>Thank goodness!</i>

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.050
<i>Stop right there!</i>

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:40.720
<i>As I said earlier, you are
to guard the conference center!</i>

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:42.090
<i>B-but...</i>

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:46.680
<i>The RHG might not be an army,
but a superior's orders are absolute!</i>

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.760
<i>Y-yeah, but we're also siblings...</i>

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.500
<i>Your brothers are worried about you...</i>

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:55.190
<i>Natsu-ne!</i>

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.270
<i>S-sorry...</i>

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:04.720
<i>I'll leave the pursuit to Kosuna-san,
Amagumo-san, and Kaido-san.</i>

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:05.510
<i>Got it!</i>

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.750
<i>Leave it to me...</i>

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:11.600
<i>U-umm... What about me?</i>

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.400
<i>Idiot! You be quiet
and wait in the truck!</i>

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:19.170
<i>Oh, how kind! Concerned for
your cute little minion, are we?</i>

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.470
<i>Y-you wish!</i>

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.680
<i>Take him with you.</i>

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.710
<i>But...</i>

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.850
<i>Actual combat experience is important.</i>

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:29.060
<i>If you say so, Natsuko-san...</i>

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:31.080
<i>Now that's decided...</i>

00:11:32.720 --> 00:11:34.860
<i>This prey is mine!</i>

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:37.690
<i>Hey! No head starts!</i>

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.530
<i>Good grief.</i>

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.990
<i>- Well, whadya say we go?
- R-right!</i>

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.540
<i>This looks bad. They're headed
for the conference center!</i>

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.520
<i>They stopped...</i>

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:04.380
<i>It looks like they took off
with a rocket winch or something...</i>

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:18.760
<i>What the?!</i>

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.310
<i>Taiko-san. Something strange is...</i>

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:32.580
<i>Call me "sensei"!</i>

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.890
<i>Taiko-san!</i>

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.560
<i>What're you doing?!</i>

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.540
<i>What the heck is that thing?!</i>

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.770
<i>I-it's a ghost!</i>

00:12:55.770 --> 00:12:58.270
<i>Idiot! Like ghosts shoot guns!</i>

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:03.490
<i>Well, the fact it makes no sense
puts it on the same level as a ghost...</i>

00:13:05.710 --> 00:13:07.530
<i>A legacy from the Dark Age!</i>

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.580
<i>I once heard they have special camouflage</i>

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:17.750
<i>capable of avoiding not just sensors,
but human eyesight as well!</i>

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.460
<i>Oh no! The conference center!</i>

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.340
<i>An unseen enemy, huh?</i>

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.100
<i>I couldn't ask for a better opponent...</i>

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.470
<i>Let's go, then!</i>

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.940
<i>However, I just remembered
something I forgot!</i>

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.720
<i>I leave the rest to you!</i>

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:41.550
<i>H-he ran away!</i>

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:44.990
<i>Adios!</i>

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:47.820
<i>Bastard!</i>

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:50.780
<i>In any case, I must go!</i>

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:53.160
<i>Can you?</i>

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:58.230
<i>Even if we are up against powerful,
vile robot soldiers...</i>

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.630
<i>...using Dark Age super-science...</i>

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.720
<i>...I... must go!</i>

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:13.950
<i>Asari-chan! And Shijimi-chan!</i>

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:17.690
<i>I absolutely must let this
first meeting of the RHG succeed</i>

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:22.940
<i>to keep any more sisters like you
from befalling misfortune!</i>

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:27.600
<i>I'll do it! For the love and
peace of all the desert people!</i>

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:29.910
<i>Stupid!</i>

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.120
<i>So cool!</i>

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:33.750
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.340
<i>So, how'd it go?</i>

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:41.040
<i>Just some minor equipment damage.
No problems.</i>

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:45.800
<i>Hey, be careful, now. Your super-fancy
equipment'll be for naught.</i>

00:14:45.910 --> 00:14:49.380
<i>Don't worry. I will
accomplish the mission.</i>

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:54.990
<i>See that you do. Your guys'
master is here to watch today.</i>

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.270
<i>I see. Give him my regards.</i>

00:14:58.460 --> 00:15:01.730
<i>He gives his regards, Master!</i>

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:12.070
<i>You all right?!</i>

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:16.760
<i>C'mon, Mitsuru!
Quit your pantin', will ya?!</i>

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:19.200
<i>S-sorry...</i>

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:20.920
<i>So, this is...</i>

00:15:21.220 --> 00:15:23.220
<i>...the entrance to
the conference center?!</i>

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:26.710
<i>Yeah. They've built a conference center
in the ruins below.</i>

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:30.720
<i>General Kawaguchi and her brothers
should already be at the bottom.</i>

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:34.300
<i>Old man Kaizuka, too?</i>

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.730
<i>He's here, of course.</i>

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:37.640
<i>I'm relieved to hear that!</i>

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.300
<i>Thanks for showing the way!</i>

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:52.820
<i>You can be so cunning,
yet make such mistakes in judgment.</i>

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:55.490
<i>Humans are such fascinating creatures.</i>

00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:00.830
<i>It's a pity, but you must die.</i>

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.290
<i>Kaido-san!</i>

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:06.910
<i>- Mitsuru!
- Yes?!</i>

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:09.100
<i>- Do your Hulkosis right now!
- Eh?</i>

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:12.330
<i>It's the only way
out of this predicament!</i>

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:14.400
<i>What on earth are you...</i>

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.140
<i>Just do it!</i>

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:19.220
<i>Eh?! W-what are you talking about?!</i>

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.360
<i>What a pain!</i>

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:27.310
<i>W-what are you doing, Taiko-san?!</i>

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:34.360
<i>I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry about the
Heracles Goldion Beetle thing!</i>

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.030
<i>That's not what I mean!</i>

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:51.940
<i>I, Kaido Masaru, for the freedom
and peace of the desert people,</i>

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:56.500
<i>cannot afford to lose... here!</i>

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:01.310
<i>Amusing.</i>

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.400
<i>And interesting.</i>

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:08.390
<i>You appear skilled for a human,
but my objective comes first.</i>

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:10.820
<i>Let us square off next time.</i>

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:15.860
<i>- Running away?!
- Bastard!</i>

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.320
<i>- It's no use!
- Oh no! He's heading underground!</i>

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.040
<i>Simpleton!</i>

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:29.810
<i>Yo.</i>

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:34.840
<i>What a shame. You've entered
my threaded barrier.</i>

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:38.840
<i>And the thing I forgot
was back in the truck.</i>

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:41.590
<i>A can of paint...</i>

00:17:41.590 --> 00:17:42.640
<i>Amagumo!</i>

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.130
<i>Nice idea!</i>

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:49.020
<i>I bet he just found a paint can
while he was running away...</i>

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:51.440
<i>Never mind that, just shoot!</i>

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:54.220
<i>- Yeah, yeah!
- You got it!</i>

00:17:57.040 --> 00:18:01.220
<i>To think we descendents of the
Dark Age could lose to mere paint...</i>

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:02.510
<i>However!</i>

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:05.580
<i>Look out!</i>

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.360
<i>T-thank you!</i>

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.540
<i>And we almost had him!</i>

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.600
<i>You're certainly a tough one...</i>

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.380
<i>What now?</i>

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.860
<i>We can't let him get underground!</i>

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:37.440
<i>- Crap!
- Natsuko-san and the others!</i>

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.280
<i>Look like it's "game over"!</i>

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.050
<i>It's not over just...</i>

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:51.310
<i>No way...</i>

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:53.450
<i>D-does this mean...</i>

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.980
<i>It's all over... Master...</i>

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:05.770
<i>That gal's good!</i>

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.060
<i>Well, so long...</i>

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.180
<i>H-he's quick to run again!</i>

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:16.940
<i>Master! We better run, too!</i>

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.260
<i>Hey! You find it?!</i>

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.460
<i>Nope! Not yet!</i>

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:33.080
<i>Eh?! The strategy meeting
was all a lie?!</i>

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:34.670
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:19:34.670 --> 00:19:38.940
<i>It was all a feint intended to
lure out and decimate the enemy.</i>

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.710
<i>N-no way!</i>

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.790
<i>That's so mean, Natsu-ne!</i>

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:47.650
<i>You even used me as a decoy!
Impressive, Sergeant Kawaguchi!</i>

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:59.070
<i>Well, it was still her plan.
Shouldn't we be happy we helped with it?</i>

00:19:59.230 --> 00:20:03.200
<i>Though you only caught one measly one...</i>

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:05.200
<i>That's plenty.</i>

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:07.700
<i>I-I found it!</i>

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:09.700
<i>Bastard's...</i>

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.710
<i>Is it still alive?</i>

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:14.750
<i>Spectacular.</i>

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:18.850
<i>Such an impressive trap...</i>

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:19.960
<i>What about the rest?</i>

00:20:20.520 --> 00:20:23.950
<i>No luck. It's either blown up
or under the rubble.</i>

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.250
<i>I see...</i>

00:20:25.250 --> 00:20:31.230
<i>So you concocted this big charade
to get their secret of immortality...</i>

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.330
<i>Kaizuka-san requested it.</i>

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:36.200
<i>Not that old man again!</i>

00:20:36.800 --> 00:20:39.570
<i>At any rate, this is
a huge catch in itself.</i>

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:43.230
<i>Look out, Natsuko!</i>

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:44.530
<i>Where is he?!</i>

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:47.600
<i>Look!</i>

00:20:48.380 --> 00:20:57.520
<i>T-truly... impressive...
shooting... Master...</i>

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.890
<i>"Master"?</i>

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.140
<i>You're pretty good, for a human.</i>

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:17.690
<i>Hitting him from this distance...</i>

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:21.020
<i>Up and vanished again, huh?</i>

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.580
<i>Later!</i>

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.660
<i>Yeah, see ya!</i>

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:33.160
<i>Man... Talk about an exhausting job...</i>

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:35.520
<i>Are you all right, Taiko-san?</i>

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:37.370
<i>Listen, you!</i>

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:41.130
<i>W
i
n
c
h
e
s</i>

00:21:38.860 --> 00:21:41.130
<i>Sand! Get some sand!</i>

00:21:41.630 --> 00:21:43.090
<i>Get some shovels!</i>

00:21:43.600 --> 00:21:45.140
<i>Where's the fire brigade?!</i>

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.340
<i>Hurry!</i>

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.640
<i>No!</i>

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:53.840
<i>What about Matsunami-san's family?!</i>

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:56.510
<i>It's too late!
There's no way to save 'em now!</i>

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:57.810
<i>No!</i>

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:01.010
<i>Matsunami-san!</i>

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:05.690
<i>He asked me to make
a winch just like his...</i>

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:09.420
<i>Matsunami-san. Could I see it later?</i>

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:11.410
<i>Sure. No problem.</i>

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:58.630
<i>Soul Repo-Man of the Desert, Amagumo here.</i>

00:23:58.630 --> 00:24:00.980
<i>Those who remember the
Great Kanto Desert are happy.</i>

00:24:00.980 --> 00:24:03.340
<i>- Hey, quit runnin' the show!
- So here is the next RHG tale!</i>

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:06.000
<i>- There's only two episodes left! Anyways!
- So here is the next RHG tale!</i>

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:07.310
<i>Next episode is "Doubt and Ambition"!</i>

00:24:07.310 --> 00:24:08.180
<i>Miss it and...</i>

00:24:08.180 --> 00:24:10.040
<i>...the fog of war will call for Kosuna!</i>
